<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Welcome to CasperID</mj-title>
    <mj-font name="Plus Jakarta Sans" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Plus Jakarta Sans, Inter, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#626D85" line-height="1.6" />
      <mj-button background-color="#8652E2" color="white" border-radius="12px" font-weight="800" font-size="16px" inner-padding="16px 32px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .logo-text { font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; color: #1A1A2E; }
      .hero-title { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #1A1A2E; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#F8F9FF">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <mj-section padding="40px 20px 30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://www.casperid.com/logos/logo.png" width="48px" align="center" padding-bottom="12px" />
        <mj-text align="center" padding-top="0">
          <span style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; color: #1A1A2E;">Casper<span style="color: #9333EA;">ID</span></span><br />
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #626D85; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">Verify once. Reuse everywhere.</span>
        </mj-text>      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    
    <!-- Main Card -->
    <mj-section padding="0 20px 40px">
      <mj-column background-color="#ffffff" border-radius="24px" padding="50px 40px" border="1px solid #E5E7EB">
        
        <mj-text align="center" padding-bottom="20px">
          <span class="hero-title">You own your identity now, {DATA_VARIABLE:recipientName}. Let's put it to work. 🎉</span>
        </mj-text>
        
        <mj-text align="center" padding-bottom="30px">
          You’ve just taken the first step toward true data ownership. With CasperID, you don't just manage your verified identity with total privacy—you finally get paid for it.
        </mj-text>
        
        <mj-button href="https://casperid.com/profile">
          Complete Your Profile
        </mj-button>
        
        <mj-spacer height="40px" />
        
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#F3F4F6" />
        
        <mj-text font-size="14px" font-weight="700" color="#1A1A2E" text-transform="uppercase" letter-spacing="1px" padding-top="30px">
          Your path to maximum yield:
        </mj-text>
        
        <mj-text padding-top="10px">
          • <strong>Layer 2 (Prove you are human):</strong> Complete a quick liveness check to unlock basic Web3 and dApp integrations.<br/>
          • <strong>Layer 3 (Full KYC):</strong> Add your verified documents to unlock premium access to fintechs and financial services.<br/>
          • <strong>Earn 30% Yield:</strong> Once verified, you earn a cut of the fee every single time a platform requests your CasperID.
        </mj-text>
        
        <mj-spacer height="24px" />
        
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#8652E2" font-weight="700">
          Watch for Pings ⚡️
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding-top="0">
        We don't sell your data; you control it. Whenever you use CasperID to log in or verify your identity on a partner platform, you’ll receive an instant notification and your share of the verification fee. Complete your profile today to start earning.
        </mj-text>
        
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    
    <!-- Footer -->
    <mj-section padding="0 20px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#9CA3AF">
          This email was sent as part of your CasperID account setup.<br/>
          If you didn't create this account, you can safely ignore this email.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#9CA3AF" padding-top="12px">
          © 2026 CasperID Protocol. Secure. Private. Yours.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
